# .gitignore for a Unity UPM package repository.
#
# This repo's root IS the package root (package.json sits beside this file).
# It is consumed either by Git URL in Unity's Package Manager, or by being
# cloned/embedded into a project's Packages/ folder.

# ── OS cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── IDE / editor ──
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user
*.user
*.userprefs

# ── Auto-generated solution & project files ──
# Unity regenerates these; they belong to the host project, not the package.
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# ── Unity host-project folders ──
# These should never appear inside a package, but guard against a stray
# Unity launch or a mis-rooted tool creating them here.
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
*.log
mono_crash.*
sysinfo.txt

# ── Build artifacts ──
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.apk
*.aab

# ── IMPORTANT ──
# Unity .meta files MUST be committed. Every asset needs its .meta or the
# package breaks on install (broken references, reshuffled GUIDs).
# This re-admits any .meta a rule above may have swept up.
!*.meta
